@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000
@tokenA = REEMPLAZAR_ACCESS_TOKEN_A
@tokenB = REEMPLAZAR_ACCESS_TOKEN_B
@tokenC = REEMPLAZAR_ACCESS_TOKEN_C
@usernameA = gamer_a
@usernameB = gamer_b
@usernameC = gamer_c
# Copiar los ids de las respuestas 201 de cada envío.
@requestAB = 1
@requestAC = 2
@requestCB = 3

### A envía solicitud a B (copiar id en requestAB)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/friends/requests
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenA}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"username":"{{usernameB}}"}

### B ve request_received en el perfil de A
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/users/{{usernameA}}
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenB}}

### B lista las recibidas
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/friends/requests/received?page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenB}}

### C no puede aceptar la solicitud de B: 404
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/friends/requests/{{requestAB}}/accept
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenC}}

### B acepta; repetir devuelve 200 sin duplicar
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/friends/requests/{{requestAB}}/accept
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenB}}

### A lista amigos con fecha
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/friends?q={{usernameB}}&page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenA}}

### Resumen de A
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/friends/summary
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenA}}

### A envía a C (copiar id en requestAC)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/friends/requests
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenA}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"username":"{{usernameC}}"}

### C rechaza: 204, sin evento ni notificación
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/friends/requests/{{requestAC}}/reject
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenC}}

### A reintenta: 409 cooldown_active y availableAt
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/friends/requests
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenA}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"username":"{{usernameC}}"}

### C envía a B (copiar id en requestCB)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/friends/requests
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenC}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"username":"{{usernameB}}"}

### C ve las enviadas
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/friends/requests/sent
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenC}}

### C cancela; repetir devuelve 204. Puede enviar otra inmediatamente.
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/friends/requests/{{requestCB}}
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenC}}

### A elimina amistad con B; repetir devuelve 204
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/friends/{{usernameB}}
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenA}}

### A puede enviar de nuevo sin espera
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/friends/requests
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenA}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"username":"{{usernameB}}"}
